| 00 | mux_in[0] | 0 | 1 | 1 | 1 | `c \| d` |
| 01 | mux_in[1] | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 | `0` |
| 11 | mux_in[2] | 0 | 0 | 1 | 0 | `c & d` |
| 10 | mux_in[3] | 1 | 0 | 1 | 1 | `c \| ~d` |

